Subject: [PATCH 24/26] WIP: track owned headless popup hosts and expose
 lifecycle probes

Observe creation readiness, ownership, visibility and stacking without starting popup capture. Placement and composition are unqualified; keep this commit on wip/mvp-flyouts until the complete gates pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

